{"id":"technical_incident_boundary_001","chunk_id":"technical_incident_boundary_001","title":"技术故障复盘：根因未确认的分类边界","content":"故障现象已经发生，但具体根因尚未通过日志、监控、复现结果或其他直接证据确认时，应将“根因未确认”记录为遗留问题。排查假设、可能原因和待验证方向不得作为核心结论。只有会议明确确认根因后，才能提取根因结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_incident","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1-candidate","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_candidate","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1","expert_review_version":"stage5-gap-fix-candidate","status":"candidate"}}
{"id":"technical_incident_boundary_002","chunk_id":"technical_incident_boundary_002","title":"技术故障复盘：止血措施、根因结论与后续待办","content":"增加监控、回滚、限流、重启或继续排查属于止血措施或后续待办，不等于已经确认故障根因。已发生的超时、错误率上升或服务不可用属于故障事实；未来可能再次发生及其影响才属于风险。只有会议明确确认执行某项措施时，该措施才能进入待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_incident","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1-candidate","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_candidate","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1","expert_review_version":"stage5-gap-fix-candidate","status":"candidate"}}